   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1783184555318\" id=\"item-6a49397405001c4504f123ae\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/82186a80-80ad-4d1e-922d-f919deb9b6e8_768/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/82186a80-80ad-4d1e-922d-f919deb9b6e8_768/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"85d10b2d43fabcde8eec\" id=\"block-85d10b2d43fabcde8eec\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">So good we\u2019re doing it again!!!  <strong>DJ DIRTYHERTZ</strong> is back with his crew manifesting the best Day Dance Party on the SF waterfront!  Seriously, the last Darty was euphoric the sun was shining the music was buummmpping and everyone was shaking it hard!  You don\u2019t want to miss this.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you like house music, if you like to dance in the sunshine, if you just need to let loose and move your body, mark your calendars and come down to Pier 23 Cafe on Saturday, June 25th. It\u2019s going to be an amazing event and even better it\u2019s FREE.  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bring a friend or meet new ones on the dance floor!</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-85d10b2d43fabcde8eec {\n    \n    \n    \n\n--tweak-text-block-background-color: init